Agents 101: Build a Multimodal AI Agent Pt. 1 with Suraj Subramanian
Livestream

Prerequisites:

Download Muse Code
Sign in to Muse Code with your API Key
The repository for the workshop is here: https://github.com/meta-models/legal-agent-workshop
Run the following commands to setup

git clone https://github.com/meta-models/legal-agent-workshop.git
cd legal-agent-workshop/agent
cp .env.example .env      # add MODEL_API_KEY here

Expect the workshop to use around $7 in tokens.
Heads up, we recommend using a macOS or Linux machine (Windows probably needs WSL, untested), git, Python 3.9 or newer for this workshop.
